      "visual_observation": "Slide19标题'Two Forces Control All Markets: Context and Momentum'，左端连续黑实体卖压被粉色框标出，红字'Sell bear breakout (BO) or pullback (PB)'，中段粉色由急跌到企稳，右端突破时强白K绿框与回踩绿区；蓝文'Buy reversal up in weak bear trend'。Slide20为Buying/Selling Pressure，标出红色暴跌段和数段绿色强阳推进。 The blue Buy reversal up in weak bear trend overlay is absent in seq1800 and seq2065, begins faint fade-in in seq2066, is fully legible in seq2075, and remains visible in seq2110; these are static slide animation stages, not live bar evolution.",
